<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Accès interdit · Rezilio</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0f172a;
            --bg-soft: #111c34;
            --panel: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72);
            --border: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
            --text: #e2e8f0;
            --muted: #94a3b8;
            --primary: #3b82f6;
            --primary-soft: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.14);
            --danger: #fb7185;
            --shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.45);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html, body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100%;
            font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18), transparent 32%),
                radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.10), transparent 28%),
                linear-gradient(180deg, #0b1220 0%, var(--bg) 100%);
            color: var(--text);
        }

        body {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 32px;
        }

        .error-shell {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 920px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
            background: var(--panel);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }

        .error-content {
            padding: 56px;
        }

        .error-aside {
            padding: 56px 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));
            border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .brand {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            color: #f8fafc;
        }

        .brand-mark {
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #60a5fa, #2563eb);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.10);
        }

        .status {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 8px 14px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: var(--primary-soft);
            color: #bfdbfe;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }

        .code {
            font-size: clamp(64px, 10vw, 104px);
            line-height: 0.95;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.04em;
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            color: #f8fafc;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
            line-height: 1.05;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.65;
            max-width: 58ch;
        }

        .actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 28px;
        }

        .btn {
            appearance: none;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 12px 18px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: 180ms ease;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #2563eb;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
            color: var(--text);
            border-color: var(--border);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        }

        .card {
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.025);
        }

        .card-title {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        .card p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .hint {
            margin-top: 18px;
            color: #fda4af;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 860px) {
            .error-shell {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .error-aside {
                border-left: 0;
                border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
                padding-top: 28px;
            }

            .error-content,
            .error-aside {
                padding: 32px 24px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="error-shell" role="main">
        <section class="error-content">
            <div class="brand">
                <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span>Rezilio</span>
            </div>

            <div class="status">Erreur d’autorisation</div>

            <div class="code">403</div>

            <h1>Accès interdit</h1>

            <p>
                Vous êtes bien authentifié, mais vous n’avez pas les droits nécessaires pour accéder à cette ressource.
            </p>

            <p>
                Dans Rezilio, cela signifie généralement que cette campagne, cette société ou cet élément n’appartient pas à votre périmètre autorisé.
            </p>

            <div class="actions">
                <a href="{{ path('app_default') }}" class="btn btn-primary">Retour à l’application</a>
                <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="btn btn-secondary">Revenir en arrière</a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <aside class="error-aside">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-title">Pourquoi cette page ?</div>
                <p>
                    Votre session est valide, mais la politique d’accès de Rezilio empêche l’ouverture directe de cette URL hors de votre société ou sans autorisation suffisante.
                </p>
            </div>

            {% if exception is defined and exception.message %}
                <p class="hint">{{ exception.message }}</p>
            {% endif %}
        </aside>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
